(7679958, 1255855, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey Nikki .. just noticed you mentioned me in the tiniest violin .. <br/>i''m very surprised this didnt do better .. <br/>there are quite a few that surprised me in this challenge that should have got way higher scores .. <br/>i think the low voters were out in force  .. altho i dont often check .. but i did in this challenge .. <br/>i got two votes of 3 and two votes of 4 .. sometimes its like a little kick to the guts when you dont understand why .. even accounting for tastes .. <br/>so onto a more positive note .. i loved reading what you wrote in the photographer''s comment .. especially this bit .. <br/>"However, the inherent symbolism also emphasizes that, though we may differ - and differ strongly - on so many issues, we are yet united; at the core, we are but one." .. <br/>can you imagine what our world would be like if a huge percentage of the population believed that truth .. we are all one .. there would be no place for greed and fear .. and getting ahead at the expense of others ... <br/>if we treated each other like brothers and sisters it would open the doors to love  .. <br/>hopefully .. !! .. ;) .. xx</td>', 'hey Nikki .. just noticed you mentioned me in the tiniest violin .. i''m very surprised this didnt do better .. there are quite a few that surprised me in this challenge that should have got way higher scores .. i think the low voters were out in force  .. altho i dont often check .. but i did in this challenge .. i got two votes of 3 and two votes of 4 .. sometimes its like a little kick to the guts when you dont understand why .. even accounting for tastes .. so onto a more positive note .. i loved reading what you wrote in the photographer''s comment .. especially this bit .. "However, the inherent symbolism also emphasizes that, though we may differ - and differ strongly - on so many issues, we are yet united; at the core, we are but one." .. can you imagine what our world would be like if a huge percentage of the population believed that truth .. we are all one .. there would be no place for greed and fear .. and getting ahead at the expense of others ... if we treated each other like brothers and sisters it would open the doors to love  .. hopefully .. !! .. ;) .. xx', '2020-11-22 20:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
